// RingOut application icon resource.
//
// The numeric ID 101 matches DolphinNoGUI/resource.h's IDI_ICON1
// (define IDI_ICON1 MAKEINTRESOURCE(101)), which PlatformWin32.cpp passes to
// LoadIcon for the game window class, and SDL3's Windows intresource icon
// hint (SDL_HINT_WINDOWS_INTRESOURCE_ICON="101"), which the launcher sets
// before SDL_Init so the launcher window class picks the same icon.
//
// Embedding this resource is what actually makes the icon visible: without an
// icon group in the binary, LoadIcon(nullptr=system, 101) and SDL3's
// EnumResourceNames fallback both find nothing and Windows shows the generic
// blank application icon in the title bar and task bar.
//
// Compiler note: this file is referenced directly from CMake for both
// moderngekko-run and moderngekko-launcher on WIN32, so it must stay free of
// #include directives that depend on a specific resource compiler's include
// path. "ringout.ico" is resolved relative to this file's directory.
101 ICON "ringout.ico"